<main id="main">
<div class="view" data-view="work">
  <section class="nw-ask nw-wrap" aria-labelledby="nw-title">
    <h1 id="nw-title"><span>How can I</span> <span class="nw-spray">help?</span></h1>
    <div>
      <p class="nw-say">Need a hand with a document, some writing, a presentation, or a spreadsheet? Tell me what you’re working on and where you’re stuck. I’ll take a look and let you know how I can help.</p>
      <a class="nw-btn" href="#help-form">Tell me what you need</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="nw-wrap" aria-label="What I can help with">
    <ul class="nw-can">
      <li><b>Sort out a document</b>Letters, forms, flyers, résumés, or something that needs cleaning up.</li>
      <li><b>Find the right words</b>Bios, descriptions, social posts, proofreading, and editing.</li>
      <li><b>Put a presentation together</b>Organize your ideas into clear, readable slides.</li>
      <li><b>Organize the details</b>Typing, lists, records, spreadsheets, and simple trackers.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="nw-shown nw-wrap" aria-labelledby="nw-shown-title">
    <h2 id="nw-shown-title">What finished work looks like</h2>
    <p class="nw-say">Four examples I made to show the kind of work you get back. The people and businesses in them are made up. Open one to see it full size.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/assets/work-samples/resume.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="pic"><img src="/assets/work-samples/resume.jpg" alt="Example resume for a made-up customer service lead" width="640" height="828" loading="lazy"></span><b>A resume</b><small>One clean page, with the strongest facts up top.</small></a></li>
      <li><a href="/assets/work-samples/flyer.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="pic"><img src="/assets/work-samples/flyer.jpg" alt="Example flyer for a made-up neighborhood coat drive" width="640" height="828" loading="lazy"></span><b>A flyer</b><small>What, when and where, readable from across a room.</small></a></li>
      <li><a href="/assets/work-samples/deck.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="pic"><img src="/assets/work-samples/deck.jpg" alt="Example three-slide presentation for a made-up bakery" width="640" height="551" loading="lazy"></span><b>A presentation</b><small>A few clear slides, one idea on each.</small></a></li>
      <li><a href="/assets/work-samples/tracker.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="pic"><img src="/assets/work-samples/tracker.jpg" alt="Example monthly bills tracker for a made-up household" width="640" height="372" loading="lazy"></span><b>A tracker</b><small>A simple sheet that adds itself up.</small></a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <svg class="nw-rule" viewBox="0 0 1200 30" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 15 H470 L486 15 L498 4 L512 27 L526 1 L540 22 L552 15 H640 L652 9 L664 21 L676 15 H1200"/></svg>

  <section class="nw-job nw-wrap" aria-labelledby="nw-job-title">
    <span class="nw-tag">Finished job</span>
    <h2 id="nw-job-title">When It Isn’t Your Kitchen</h2>
    <p class="nw-sub">A single and music video from GhostHeart Studios, out since Monday, Nov 23.</p>
    <div class="nw-grid">
      <div>
        <a class="nw-watch" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z00btt9OHWg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <img src="https://i.ytimg.com/vi/z00btt9OHWg/mqdefault.jpg" alt="When It Isn’t Your Kitchen music video" width="320" height="180" loading="lazy">
          <span>▶ When It Isn’t Your Kitchen, full music video on YouTube</span>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>The story it tells</h3>
        <p class="nw-week">It follows a mother whose husband is admired all over town. Behind closed doors he controls the money, the car keys and the front door.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <svg class="nw-rule" viewBox="0 0 1200 30" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 15 H470 L486 15 L498 4 L512 27 L526 1 L540 22 L552 15 H640 L652 9 L664 21 L676 15 H1200"/></svg>

  <section class="nw-tell nw-wrap" id="ask">
    <div class="nw-card">
      <h2>Tell me what you need</h2>
<!--HELP-FORM-->
    </div>
    <div class="nw-card nw-side">
      <p>Rather email?</p>
      <p class="nw-mail"><a href="mailto:signal@myghostheart.com">signal@myghostheart.com</a></p>
<!--PRICES-->
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="nw-song nw-wrap">
    <div class="nw-card song-opt">
      <h2>A song from your story</h2>
<!--SONG-->
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
</main>
